data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_tP2DoKMkVJpyt8BMfOOzqotH"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Asha Pell (person) [ID: 5affd0ca-9c42-4463-bed7-ad12e3c38d62] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Asha Pell captains the courier ship Nightjar, grew up in Vesper, and belongs to the Lantern Guild. Her crew usually calls her Captain Ash.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - CAPTAINS → Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: 36eac936-9ce0-4b27-9bf4-f77ae290dfa1]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell.\n  - GREW_UP_IN → Vesper (city, port city) [ID: ccb13663-df18-4e63-b89c-006464a6cfb2]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - MEMBER_OF → Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: a4140448-57b9-47e2-9fad-b44a4a957bdd]: Maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners. It does not own the mines.\n\nOrin's mines (mines) [ID: 623be29f-ae99-4f3a-b37e-8ee2e0ff0cd4]: Mines on the island of Orin. The Lantern Guild does not own them; it buys blue salt from Orin's miners.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← WORKS_IN from Orin's miners (miners, group) [ID: 01f68fd0-b24a-490d-86d5-43195a8bd524]: Miners on Orin who mine blue salt; the Lantern Guild buys salt from them.\n  - LOCATED_IN → Orin (island) [ID: 31795bd3-db8b-4121-a619-b483ad06b17a]: An island where blue salt is mined by its miners.\n\nLantern Guild (guild) [ID: a4140448-57b9-47e2-9fad-b44a4a957bdd]: Maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners. It does not own the mines.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← MAINTAINED_BY from Vesper lighthouse (lighthouse, landmark) [ID: 18f09cc9-0d1f-4860-a786-04aae26429af]: The tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt and it is maintained by the Lantern Guild.\n  - ← MEMBER_OF from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 5affd0ca-9c42-4463-bed7-ad12e3c38d62] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Asha Pell captains the courier ship Nightjar, grew up in Vesper, and belongs to the Lantern Guild. Her crew usually calls her Captain Ash.\n  - BUYS_FROM → Orin's miners (miners, group) [ID: 01f68fd0-b24a-490d-86d5-43195a8bd524]: Miners on Orin who mine blue salt; the Lantern Guild buys salt from them.\n\nVesper lighthouse (lighthouse, landmark) [ID: 18f09cc9-0d1f-4860-a786-04aae26429af]: The tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt and it is maintained by the Lantern Guild.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - LOCATED_IN → Vesper (city, port city) [ID: ccb13663-df18-4e63-b89c-006464a6cfb2]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - MAINTAINED_BY → Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: a4140448-57b9-47e2-9fad-b44a4a957bdd]: Maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners. It does not own the mines.\n  - USES → Blue salt (mineral, resource) [ID: a904844d-81e0-40dd-9f91-77fbdc115adb]: Salt used to power the lenses of Vesper's lighthouse; mined on the island of Orin.\n\nOrin's miners (miners, group) [ID: 01f68fd0-b24a-490d-86d5-43195a8bd524]: Miners on Orin who mine blue salt; the Lantern Guild buys salt from them.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← BUYS_FROM from Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: a4140448-57b9-47e2-9fad-b44a4a957bdd]: Maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners. It does not own the mines.\n  - LOCATED_IN → Orin (island) [ID: 31795bd3-db8b-4121-a619-b483ad06b17a]: An island where blue salt is mined by its miners.\n  - WORKS_IN → Orin's mines (mines) [ID: 623be29f-ae99-4f3a-b37e-8ee2e0ff0cd4]: Mines on the island of Orin. The Lantern Guild does not own them; it buys blue salt from Orin's miners."}]}}

